# Orlando's Antiques (otherAreas 7): the OrlandoRepeat and count edges. Accepted (a GM), Windurst fame 50 and the
# Chocobo License. 8 Beastcoins and a Goblin Die (8 of the slot's item, 9 items): nothing. 103 while accepted: its
# finish sets nothing (not completed), so once completed (a GM) 8 Beastcoins: nothing (OrlandoRepeat 0). 103:
# OrlandoRepeat 1; 8: 102 (600, 656), finished: OrlandoRepeat 0, so 8 more: nothing. OrlandoRepeat 2 (a GM; no script
# sets it): 8: nothing (the trade reads OrlandoRepeat == 1).
char zone=Mhaura pos=-36.5,-8.0,59.3 job=WAR lvl=20
fame Windurst 50
keyitem ChocoboLicense
quest OtherAreas.OrlandosAntiques accepted
item Beastcoin x12
item Beastcoin x12
item GoblinDie x1
login
trade Orlando Beastcoin x8 GoblinDie x1 # accepted, 8 of the slot's item, 9 items: nothing
trigger Orlando                         # accepted: 103
finish                                  # not completed: OrlandoRepeat stays 0
quest OtherAreas.OrlandosAntiques completed  # a GM
trade Orlando Beastcoin x8              # completed, OrlandoRepeat 0: nothing
trigger Orlando                         # completed: 103
finish                                  # OrlandoRepeat 1
trade Orlando Beastcoin x8              # 102 (600, 656)
finish                                  # the 8 taken; 600 gil; OrlandoRepeat 0
trade Orlando Beastcoin x8              # OrlandoRepeat 0: nothing
localvar OrlandoRepeat 2                # a GM
trade Orlando Beastcoin x8              # OrlandoRepeat 2, not 1: nothing
